      ],
      "en": "Don’t give your strength to women, nor your ways to that which destroys kings.",
      "ko": "네 힘을 여자들에게 쓰지 말며 왕들을 멸망시키는 일을 행치 말찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "d6903637f1a6465489a2d90f7262fae64a1b6a595a3f4ec0a653e02c637fb9d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "431c16acb795bc306d023b600e9edd7f3de9071f490d6c69b2dfbad26725d477",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 힘을 여자들에게 쓰지 말며 왕들을 멸망시키는 일을 행치 말찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "431c16acb795bc306d023b600e9edd7f3de9071f490d6c69b2dfbad26725d477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PRO:31:4",
